      "text": "METROBASE Traffic Update as of 5:00PM\n\nWHEN: June 01, 2025\n\nA. MAJOR ROADS:\n\n*EDSA\nSOUTHBOUND\n- Munoz to Bansalangin, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Kamuning to Rochester, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Tramo to TaftAvenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND\n- Park Avenueto Taft Avenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Ayala to Buendia, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n-  Pioneer to Ortigas, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Trinoma to Quezon City Academy, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*C5\nSOUTHBOUND\n- Xavierville Avenue to Aurora blvd, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Julia Vargas to Lanuza, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND: \n- Lanuza, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Vridgetowne to Eastwood, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles and DPWH Roadworks at Eastwood)\n- Blueridge, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Miriam College to Balara, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*COMMONWEALTH\nEASTBOUND:\n- Regalado Avenue to Regalado Highway, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Regalado Highway to Regalado Avenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Sct. Albano to EDSA, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Senator Miriam Defensor-Santiago Avenue to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n- Robinson Metro East to Burger King, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- light traffic\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Meralco Avenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- CCF C5, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND\n- Meralco Avenue to EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Santolan, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- light traffic\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Padre Faura, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Luneta to Padre Burgos Avenue, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- EDSA, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- light traffic\n\n#mmda",
